    {
      "id": "h6",
      "html": "RevOps services that scale with you, <span class=\"hl\">wherever you're at</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h7",
      "html": "Most engagements start with one of these and grow into another. You do not need to know which one you need before the first call."
    },
    {
      "id": "h8",
      "html": "Solution design"
    },
    {
      "id": "h9",
      "html": "2–3 weeks"
    },
    {
      "id": "h10",
      "html": "The plan before the build. Data model, lifecycle, process map and how you will measure it, signed off by the people who have to live with it."
    },
    {
      "id": "h11",
      "html": "Read more <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h12",
      "html": "CRM implementations"
    },
    {
      "id": "h13",
      "html": "6–12 weeks"
    },
    {
      "id": "h14",
      "html": "Portal builds and platform migrations. Built once, documented, and handed over so your team can run it without us."
    },
    {
      "id": "h15",
      "html": "Read more <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h16",
      "html": "HubSpot support retainers"
    },
    {
      "id": "h17",
      "html": "Monthly"
    },
    {
      "id": "h18",
      "html": "A HubSpot admin on call. Roadmap, maintenance, training, and someone who answers when a workflow breaks on a Friday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "id": "h19",
      "html": "Read more <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h20",
      "html": "RevOps consulting"
    },
    {
      "id": "h21",
      "html": "Monthly"
    },
    {
      "id": "h22",
      "html": "Someone to think it through with. What the system should be doing, what it is doing instead, and which of those gaps is actually costing you money."
    },
    {
      "id": "h23",
      "html": "Read more <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h24",
      "html": "Lead to cash process mapping"
    },
    {
      "id": "h25",
      "html": "2–3 weeks"
    },
    {
      "id": "h26",
      "html": "Every step from first touch to paid invoice, on one page. Usually the first time anyone has seen the whole thing at once."
    },
    {
      "id": "h27",
      "html": "Read more <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>"
