      "id": "h47",
      "html": "<span class=\"hl\">Small by design</span> and staying that way"
    },
    {
      "id": "h48",
      "html": "A large agency wins by staffing. It sells you a senior name, then hands the build to whoever is free that month, and the person who understood your business leaves the project before it ships. We would rather take fewer clients and keep the same people on them, which means we still know how your system works a year later, because we built it."
    },
    {
      "id": "h49",
      "html": "You talk to the people doing the work, start to finish"
    },
    {
      "id": "h50",
      "html": "Deep in revenue operations only, not a generalist shop with a RevOps page"
    },
    {
      "id": "h51",
      "html": "HubSpot Platinum Solutions Partner"
    },
    {
      "id": "h52",
      "html": "The wrong call if you need five bodies on site next week, and we will say so"
    },
    {
      "id": "h53",
      "html": "Experts in <span class=\"hl\">all of the tools</span> in your RevOps stack"
    },
    {
      "id": "h54",
      "html": "Most of the work is making these talk to each other properly. We have been inside all of them, and we will tell you when the one you own is already good enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "h55",
      "html": "What clients say about working with us"
    },
    {
      "id": "h56",
      "html": "<span class=\"q\">“</span> Superior expertise <span class=\"q\">”</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h57",
      "html": "Our experience working with RevHops to build out specific functionality, reporting, workflows, sequences and dashboards has exceeded expectations. <span class=\"hl\">James has taken the time to learn our business model, understand the complexities and remained confident and transparent</span> on what we can and cannot do within the platform. Looking forward to continued partnership with RevHops."
    },
    {
      "id": "h58",
      "html": "Deborah <span class=\"sep\">|</span> COO"
    },
    {
      "id": "h59",
      "html": "<span class=\"q\">“</span> Responsive &amp; Thorough <span class=\"q\">”</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h60",
      "html": "We partnered with RevHops on a complex HubSpot Marketing Hub Enterprise implementation, and the experience was excellent from start to finish. James was highly responsive, extremely well-organized, and thorough. <span class=\"hl\">RevHops put together a clear, structured plan, communicated recommendations in a way that was easy to align on</span>, and followed up proactively to ensure everyone fully understood the strategy and next steps."
    },
    {
      "id": "h61",
      "html": "Amy <span class=\"sep\">|</span> VP of Client Services"
    },
    {
      "id": "h62",
      "html": "<span class=\"q\">“</span> Great team to work with! <span class=\"q\">”</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "h63",
      "html": "<span class=\"hl\">James set our small company up for success through his proven process</span> and knowledge of HubSpot after meeting with key people on my team and then mapping everything out for us for the first time. His team was organized in their implementation and tracked our progress throughout the project. We will be using RevHops more in the near future. Highly recommend!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "h64",
      "html": "Adam <span class=\"sep\">|</span> CEO"
    },
    {
      "id": "h65",
      "html": "Ready to hop <br>with RevHops?"
    },
